# Vercel builds the app itself, so it only needs the sources.
#
# 2026-09-26: without this the CLI tried to upload 231 MB — every node_modules
# tree, the built dist/, the desktop app's Rust target/ and the diagram assets —
# and stalled at 0 bytes. The build installs its own dependencies on Vercel's
# machine, so none of that needs to travel.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
target
**/target
.git
.vercel
*.log
supabase/.temp
